                                "sense_id": "2d5928c0-083b-3800-8da7-831d0ed1a4a7",
                                "text": "1992, Geoffrey Wall, translator of Gustave Flaubert, Madame Bovary\nThese gentlemen were greatly astonished at Bovary's romantic ideas, and the pharmacist hurried in to say to him: \"This velvet looks to me rather a superfetation. Besides, the expense...\""
                            }
